NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001000 "supported. He also conned me into doing the time based stuff.  Thanks Kevin!"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001001 ":-)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001002 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001003 "Thanks also to Dan Waldheim for helping with some of the locking issues in a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001004 "forked environment."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001005 ""
